<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Baan.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Baan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Wertpapier GmbH has issued 10 million American-style warrants in two equal tranches on Baan Company, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co OHG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 16.OCT.96-09.JAN.98   PAYDATE	15.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-FRFT, DUSS, STUT,     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  60.70 DFL</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE    ISSUE	PREMIUM	 GEARING</p>
<p> TRANCHE I     55 DFL    1.63 DEM   20.64 PCT     3.33 X</p>
<p> TRANCHE II    70 DFL    1.13 DEM   36.19 PCT     4.79 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
